=== clipboard transport cost (median of 7 runs per size) ===

--- the OSC 52 path: crossterm's own writer, buffered (no terminal in the loop)
    this is encode + format only: base64 and the escape framing, in-process
          128 B payload ->       181 B on the wire (1.4x)  median   0.002 ms  best   0.002 ms  worst   0.015 ms
         4096 B payload ->      5473 B on the wire (1.3x)  median   0.025 ms  best   0.025 ms  worst   0.030 ms
        65536 B payload ->     87393 B on the wire (1.3x)  median   0.382 ms  best   0.381 ms  worst   0.393 ms
      1048576 B payload ->   1398113 B on the wire (1.3x)  median   6.117 ms  best   6.111 ms  worst   6.385 ms

--- native helper: `pbcopy` + `pbpaste` (spawn, pipe, wait; then read back and compare)
          128 B payload   write median   9.716 ms (best   8.793, worst  10.606)  + read-back median  10.663 ms   bytes match
         4096 B payload   write median   8.899 ms (best   8.765, worst   9.177)  + read-back median   9.690 ms   bytes match
        65536 B payload   write median   8.928 ms (best   8.716, worst   9.136)  + read-back median   9.819 ms   bytes match
      1048576 B payload   write median   9.735 ms (best   9.574, worst   9.933)  + read-back median  10.580 ms   bytes match

=== what N could mean: the same text in three units ===
    cells are measured with unicode-width 0.2, the crate the renderer uses

text                                 chars   cells   bytes
