🇯🇵                                       2       2       8
a	b                                      3       3       3
Café ☕ naïve                            12      13      16
const s: &str = "日本語";                  22      25      28
→ ← ↑ ↓                                  7       7      15

    ZWJ family 👩‍👩‍👦: per-character cell widths sum to 6, the whole family measures 2 cell(s)
    (so a cell count of a wrapped paragraph changes when the window is resized; the text does not change. That is the whole argument about N.)
